' UC-IAL-03 — Update Own Profile

@startuml
skinparam conditionStyle inside
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor #FFEAA7
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #DFE6E9

|WAH Service User|
start
:1.0 Access own-profile maintenance;

|Participating WAH Service|
:1.1 Request permitted profile data from WAHrden;

|WAHrden System|
:1.2 Verify authenticated user identity & permitted fields;
if (Identity/Profile available?) then (No [EF-01])
  :Return identity/profile unavailable result;
  |Participating WAH Service|
  :Display profile unavailable error;
  kill
else (Yes)
  :Return permitted profile fields;
endif

|Participating WAH Service|
:1.3 Present permitted profile information;

|WAH Service User|
:2.0 Modify permitted profile details;
if (Submit changes?) then (No / Cancel [EF-02])
  :Cancel profile update;
  kill
else (Yes [2.1])
  :Submit proposed profile changes;
endif

|Participating WAH Service|
:2.2 Forward submitted changes to WAHrden;

|WAHrden System|
:3.0 Validate requested changes against governance rules;
if (Changes permitted & complete?) then (Prohibited changes [EF-04])
  :Reject prohibited changes;
  kill
elseif (Invalid/Incomplete [EF-03])
  :Return validation issues;
  kill
else (Valid)
  :3.1 Apply profile updates;
  if (Update successful?) then (No [EF-05])
    :Return profile update failure result;
    kill
  else (Yes)
    |Database / Audit|
    :3.2 Record profile maintenance audit record;
    
    |WAHrden System|
    :Return updated profile state;
  endif
endif

|Participating WAH Service|
:3.3 Present updated profile information to user;

|WAH Service User|
:Review updated profile;
stop
@enduml
